    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Tchort is evolution, $(#brother/sister).&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Тчорт – це еволюція, $(#брате/сестро).&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>"We can and we must," said Eidein!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">"Ми можемо і ми повинні", - сказав Ейдейн!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>What can I do for you, $(#brother/sister)?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Що я можу для вас зробити, $(#брате/сестро)?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Hey, you're that novitiate... um, what was it... Yes - $(context.player.Name)!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Гей, ти той новачок... мм, як же його... Так - $(context.player.Name)!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>We haven't encountered the Faceless in years! What made them attack Core City?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ми не зустрічали Безликих роками! Що змусило їх напасти на Core City?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I don't think there is a library in South Underrail that can match ours.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я не думаю, що в Південному Underrail є бібліотека, яка могла б зрівнятися з нашою.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Tchort guide you, wherever you may be.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Тчорт веди тебе, де б ти не був.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>If you're hungry, the refectory is just west of the man hall.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Якщо ти голодний, їдальня знаходиться трохи на захід від головного залу.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>The West Wing has been opened a few days ago - do not go there!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Західний корпус було відкрито кілька днів тому - не ходи туди!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
